Release/
**/Release/

# ===== 图标替换/产物整理产生的旧文件备份与检查图（安全网，不入库）=====
*.bak
icon-backups/
**/icon-backups/

# ===== 临时脚本 / 语言同步测试产物（排查用，不入库）=====
_tmp_*.mjs
_tmp_*.txt
_cmp_*.mjs
_cmp_*.txt
_add_pckeys.mjs
_verify.mjs
*.synctest.tmp
.playwright/

